BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td (7.1 Definitions) Tj T* () Tj T* (Flight Duty Period \(FDP\) means a period that starts when a crew member reports for duty) Tj T* (and finishes when the aircraft finally comes to rest after the last sector.) Tj T* (Window of Circadian Low \(WOCL\) means the period between 02:00 and 05:59 in the time zone) Tj T* (to which the crew member is acclimatised.) Tj T* (Home base is the location assigned by the operator where the crew member normally starts duty.) Tj T* ET
endstream
