BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td (7.4 Minimum rest) Tj T* () Tj T* (The minimum rest period before a flight duty period starting at home base is 12 hours) Tj T* (or the length of the preceding duty period, whichever is greater.) Tj T* (The minimum rest period away from home base is 10 hours, including 8 hours of sleep opportunity.) Tj T* (Rest periods must be planned in the roster and published at least 14 days in advance.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
