BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 780 Td (7.5 Extended rest) Tj T* () Tj T* (Each crew member must receive a recurrent extended rest period of 36 hours including two local nights) Tj T* (so that there are never more than 168 hours between the end of one extended rest and the start of the next.) Tj T* (Table 7.5: Extended rest) Tj T* (Period | Minimum | Nights) Tj T* (Recurrent | 36 hours | 2 local nights) Tj T* (After 4 time zones | 48 hours | 2 local nights) Tj T* ET
endstream
